<section class="intro">
<p class="kicker">CLOUD SLAYER</p>
<h1>Tool Library.</h1>
<p class="lede">Find Nathan AI tools and open-source kernels, runtimes, workers, bots, agents, and repositories.</p>
</section>
<div class="row slayer-links">
<a href="/cloud-slayer">Worker registry</a>
<a href="/cloud-slayer?view=sos">SOS worker modules</a>
</div>
<section class="card stack">
<h2>Search the catalog</h2>
<form id="tool-search" class="slayer-search" role="search">
<label>Tool name or keyword <input name="q" type="search" maxlength="96" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Source <select name="source"><option value="">All sources</option><option value="upstream">Open-source projects</option><option value="nathan-ai">Nathan AI</option></select></label>
<label>Starts with <select name="letter"><option value="">A–Z</option></select></label>
<button class="primary" type="submit">Search</button>
</form>
<p id="tool-status" role="status">Loading tools…</p>
<ul id="tool-results" class="slayer-results"></ul>
<button id="tool-more" type="button" hidden>Show more</button>
</section>
